  "scientific_question": "After accepted SI-002 catalog classes 1-5 and the explicit Owner flip that records only evaluation_execution_authority false-to-true with planner still false, what closed-world boundary freezes PB-B5-SI-003 as still open, keeps scalarization/performance/superiority authority false, and makes clear that evaluation_execution_authority=true is not a performance or scalarization grant?",
